hase-submersible-pump28485677525.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Single Phase Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>Single phase submersible pump of the QGDa series have been designed for maintenance-free long-term operation. Even under difficult conditions, for example fluids containing sand, the wear-resistant materials ensure optimum...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52054394\"/></p><p>single phase submersible pump<br/></p><p><img alt=\"image007(002).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231724299916485.jpg\"/></p><p> Single phase submersible pump of the QGDa series have been designed for maintenance-free long-term operation. Even under difficult conditions, for example fluids containing sand, the wear-resistant materials ensure optimum operation. The motor is perfectly matched to the pump.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (Specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Submersible screw pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Volt</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220/380V</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Speed</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2850 r/m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">QGDa</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">80-140m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q max</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1.8-2.3 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.37-1.1kW/ 0.5-1.5HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Impeller material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">95 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">571-665 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">G 1 &amp;ldquo;</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Protection Grade</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">IP 68</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Insulation Class</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">B</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1 year</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231725568580144.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009(002).jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"image006(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231724084285241.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></p><p><strong>3. Features</strong></p><p>Submersible pumps for domestic use, multistage type with floating radial impeller. Suitable for 4” wells. Designed to lift clear and clean water, they can be used both is agricultural field, for irrigation, and in the domestic and industrial field to pressurize the water supply with a pressure tank. Capacities from 0 to 2.3 m3/h, heads from 7 to 140m. Maximum pump’s diameter 95 mm.</p><p><strong>4. Materials</strong></p><p>Stainless steel external shell</p><p>Stainless steel Motor head</p><p>Stainless steel Coupling joint</p><p>Stainless steel Suction grid and screws</p><p>Built-in check valve</p><p><strong>5. Product Application</strong></p><p>Domestic use for civil and industrial applications.</p><p>Garden use and agriculture irrigation.</p><p>Providing your drinking water from wells or reservoirs</p><p>Irrigating your garden, lawn, lot or small holding</p><p>Farm livestock water for your animals</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231726025056042.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011(002).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Exhibition</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231726069844910.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(002).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p>Trade terms: FOB, CIF, CFR (CNF), etc</p><p>Payment terms: L/C, D/A,D/P,T/T, Western Union, MoneyGram, PayPal</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Lianyungang, Shanghai</p><p>Lead time: 20-30 days</p><p>Shipment: By sea, by air and by express delivery</p><p>Supply Capability: 100,000 Pieces per Month</p><p>Packing: Carton (with cylinder or foam), wooden box</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231726134279361.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(002).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1.Q: Are you a factory or a trading company?</strong></p><p>A: We are a manufacturer that specializes in multistage deep-well submersible pumps for more than 30 years.</p><p><strong>2.Q: What basic information is needed for selecting a submersible pump?</strong></p><p>A: Flow: How much water will be required for daily use or maximum water need in an hour/minute? And if the well could produce enough water to meet the requirements. Head: What is the vertical dimension from the pump suction chamber to water pipe final outlet?</p><p><strong>3.Q: What is the actual diameter of a 4-inch well pump? Will it fit inside my 4\" diameter well casing?</strong></p><p>A: The diameter of 4SR 4\" submersible well pump is 3.86\" (3-7/8\"). It will fit in a straight 4’’ well properly. </p><p><strong>4.Q: How long is the cable of the pump?</strong></p><p>A: Depends on our customers’ requirements.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: single phase submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-submersible-impeller-pump\"><img alt=\"2.5 Inch Submersible Impeller Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/2-5-inch-submersible-impeller-pump29176943256a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-submersible-impeller-pump\">2.5 Inch Submersible Impeller Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/submersible-pump-impeller-design\"><img alt=\"Submersible Pump Impeller Design\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-pump-impeller-design44280348583a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/submersible-pump-impeller-design\">Submersible Pump Impeller Design</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/submersible-well-water-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Well Water Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-well-water-pump12063951121a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a>